1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,400
(Penny:)Get one yourself.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,650
(Raj:)Ooh, somebody's been
taking bitchy pills.

3
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:09,310
(Penny:)God, he's an ass when he drinks.

4
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:10,660
(Howard:)Oh, he's an ass when he doesn't.

5
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:12,860
(Howard:)You just don't hear it.

6
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:15,810
(Leonard:)Think we need to start
entertaining the possibility

7
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,660
(Leonard:)that the Shamy could
go on for years.

8
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,370
(Raj:)Well, if that's the case,
Penny will have to get satellite TV

9
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:23,090
(Raj:)and maybe once a week run a
vacuum through this place.

10
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:29,130
(Penny:)I thought you were going
to talk to Sheldon.

11
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,990
I did. Well, what'd he say?

12
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:33,130
(Leonard:)Well, he pointed out that
he kinda sorta had to...

13
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:34,600
(Leonard:)put up with you.

14
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,550
(Penny:)Kinda sorta had to?

15
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:37,850
(Leonard:)I didn't agree with him.

16
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:38,850
(Penny:)Well, you defended me, right?

17
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,690
(Leonard:)I tried, but...

18
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:48,010
(Leonard:)...he made a fairly
well-reasoned argument.

19
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:51,280
(Howard:)You're not doing that right.

20
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,280
(Leonard:)What?

21
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,520
(Howard:)Gimme.

22
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,730
No. Trust me.

23
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:59,020
No! I do this for
my mom all the time.

